<markdown_cell>
# Naija ASR Benchmark — Kaggle Inference

**Goal**: Transcribe 500 Nigerian English/Pidgin audio samples with 3 Whisper models and save hypothesis CSVs.

## Prerequisites

1. A **private Kaggle dataset** containing `audio/` (500 .flac files) and `test_samples.csv` (metadata)
2. A **Kaggle Secret** named `HUGGINGFACE_HUB_TOKEN` with your HuggingFace read token (needed for `nadinev/naija-voice-model`)

**Edit `DATASET_NAME` in the next cell to match your Kaggle dataset name.**
</markdown_cell>

